idth: min(60rem, 100vw); overflow-x: scroll;"><table><thead><tr><th>Paramet=
er</th><th>Values</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbo=
dy><tr><td><code>thinking.type</code></td><td><code>enabled</code></td><td>=
<code>enabled</code></td><td>Enables thinking. <code>disabled</code> is no =
longer supported.</td></tr><tr><td><code>reasoning_effort</code></td><td><c=
ode>low</code>, <code>high</code>, <code>max</code></td><td><code>max</code=
></td><td><code>low</code>: light; <code>high</code>: enhanced; <code>max</=
code>: deep.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p class=3D"self-stretch text-grey-8 text-base font-normal leading-7"><code=
>max</code> is recommended for coding tasks.</p>
<pre class=3D"text-sm bg-card-background p-2 rounded-lg text-left font-mono=
 whitespace-pre-wrap mx-5"><code class=3D"language-json">{
  "model": "glm-5.3",
