}
</code></pre>
<p class=3D"self-stretch text-grey-8 text-base font-normal leading-7"><stro=
ng>Migration required</strong>: If your application currently uses <code>th=
inking.type: "disabled"</code>, change it to <code>enabled</code> and set <=
code>reasoning_effort</code> to <code>low</code> before updating the model =
ID to glm-5.3. <strong>Otherwise, the request will fail.</strong></p>
